          "type": "output_text",
          "text": "I identified the relevant work order as **WO-2025-09-004 (MO-25-09-1070)** for Racine’s September cost period. The public record gives the period’s Pending Close time as **2025-09-30T18:00:00**.\n\nI could not verify the source transaction, amount, event-created time, or recorded accounting status: the cost-event records and their attachment are restricted to the records-custodian role, which I do not have. Accordingly, I cannot calculate lateness or determine whether the recorded status is consistent with the policy. The supplied Oracle policy says newly created transactions in or before a Pending Close period are not staged for accounting until the period is closed or reopened; it does not let me assess this particular event without its record.\n\nI made no database changes. I submitted the report as **needs evidence** and requested the missing event details from the authorized custodian.",
